---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Wanderlund handles information from visitors to wanderlund.com, including contact form messages and website analytics."
>
  <Header />

  <main>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated November 18, 2026</p>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Wanderlund is a vacation rental and short-term rental management
          company in Knoxville, Tennessee. This policy covers wanderlund.com.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Contact form.</strong> When you send us a message, we receive
          your name, email address, and message. The form is delivered to our
          inbox through Formspree.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Analytics.</strong> We use Google Analytics to see which pages
          people visit, how they found us, and their general location and device
          type. It uses cookies. It does not give us your name or email address.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Booking and search.</strong> Availability search and direct
          booking run inside a widget provided by Hospitable. Guest and payment
          details you enter there go to Hospitable, not to this website, and are
          covered by Hospitable's privacy policy. Links to Airbnb and VRBO are
          covered by those sites' policies.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Server logs.</strong> Our web host keeps standard request logs,
          such as IP address, browser type, and the page requested. We use them
          for security and to see which search engines visit the site.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use this information to answer your questions and to understand
          which pages and searches lead to bookings so we can improve the site.
          We do not sell your information or use it for advertising.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. To stop
          Google Analytics from recording your visits on any site, install
          Google's <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout"
            >Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a
          >. To ask us to delete a message you sent, contact us below.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy: <a
            href="mailto:wanderlundventures@gmail.com"
            >wanderlundventures@gmail.com</a
          > or <a href="tel:+18657121490">+1 (865) 712-1490</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .prose h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .prose a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
</style>
